{"id":"bdffe105700c69e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-hilbert-schmidt.md","title":"Hilbert–Schmidt Operator","display":"df-hilbert-schmidt — Hilbert–Schmidt Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hilbert-schmidt","aliases":["58-df-hilbert-schmidt"],"display":"df-hilbert-schmidt — Hilbert–Schmidt Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-orthonormal-basis]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hilbert-schmidt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hilbert-schmidt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-schmidt — Hilbert–Schmidt Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"58-df-orthonormal-basis\">58-df-orthonormal-basis</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\)</span> (fully explicit Hilbert-space structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathcal H\">\\(T:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathcal H\\)</span> (bounded linear operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span> (Hilbert-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S\\)</span> (orthonormal-basis predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"58-df-orthonormal-basis\">58-df-orthonormal-basis</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\sum_{i\\in I}\\nu_B(T(e(i)))^2&lt;\\infty\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\sum_{i\\in I}\\nu_B(T(e(i)))^2&lt;\\infty\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S(T,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S(T,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit form uses the same Hilbert structure for boundedness, the orthonormal basis, and the square-summability norm.</li>\n<li>Hilbert–Schmidt operators are compact and belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^2\">\\(\\ell^2\\)</span> Schatten class.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{I}_2\">\\(\\mathcal{I}_2\\)</span> is a Hilbert space under inner product <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A, B \\rangle = \\mathrm{tr}(B^*A)\">\\(\\langle A, B \\rangle = \\mathrm{tr}(B^*A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is Hilbert–Schmidt iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span> is, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2} = \\|T^*\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2}\">\\(\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2} = \\|T^*\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For a trace-class operator, the trace norm dominates the Hilbert–Schmidt norm: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|_1\\geq\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal I_2}\">\\(\\|T\\|_1\\geq\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal I_2}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Hilbert-Schmidt norm is a downstream function built from this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-orthonormal-basis","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-orthonormal-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S$ (Hilbert-space predicate, see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S$ (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-orthonormal-basis","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S$ (orthonormal-basis predicate, see [[58-df-orthonormal-basis]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\sum_{i\\in I}\\nu_B(T(e(i)))^2<\\infty\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSchmidt}_S(T,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSchmidtStructure}_S(T,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{I}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A, B \\rangle = \\mathrm{tr}(B^*A)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2} = \\|T^*\\|_{\\mathcal{I}_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|T\\|_1\\geq\\|T\\|_{\\mathcal I_2}","display":false}],"bytes":2355,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-622","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-hilbert-schmidt.md|58-df-hilbert-schmidt]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["2ad9c248fe18df37","b70ce791d5b1a19b","bb0e606138cd791a"]}